log-blogBodyRoot"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1fqr005-Text-root" data-testid="Text-root"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">According to Sensor Tower’s App Performance Insights,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/642b4a61ad4adb7799a83a83/989673964?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Honor of Kings</u></i></a> maintained its lead in global mobile game revenue in August. In China, the game launched two major events from August 8–15: the <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://pvp.qq.com/v/detail.shtml?G_Biz=18&amp;tid=950260&amp;e_code=pvppvpweb_detail.userVideo.r1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Summer Farm Friends Festival</u></i></a> and the <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://pvp.qq.com/v/detail.shtml?G_Biz=18&amp;tid=950433&amp;e_code=pvppvpweb_detail.userVideo.r2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Endless Game Parallel World</u></i></a> skin series. The update introduced the new hero <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8bd2sdNWxYM" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><u>LuYana</u></a>, the limited-time <i>Extreme Frenzy</i> mode featuring shorter cooldowns and stackable upgrades, free draws, new cosmetics, and event-exclusive rewards to drive engagement and spending.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/62997510bafac62d04f854a3/1623318294?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Gossip Harbor</u></i></a> delivered another standout performance, supported by a carefully paced live-ops calendar. <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6787003128" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Water Wonders</u></i></a> and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6791061030" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Dollhouse of Dreams</u></i></a> carried momentum from July into the first half of the month, before<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6797865135" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Fourth-Year Festivities</u></i></a> celebrated the game’s fourth anniversary with gala-themed merge objectives and exclusive rewards. The dragon-rescue storyline<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6799062692" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Slay the Dragon, Save the Day!</u></i></a> sustained engagement through late August, while<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6799071050" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Escape from Raccoon Beach</u></i></a> and the autumn-themed<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gossip-harbor-merge-story/id1623318294?eventid=6798582593" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>The Turning Leaves</u></i></a> provided fresh collection goals extending into September.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Other top-grossing games maintained engagement and spending through a steady flow of themed events.<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/638ee532480da915a62f0b34/6443575749?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Whiteout Survival</u></i></a> delivered a packed August calendar led by its<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.facebook.com/WhiteoutSurvival/posts/the-whiteout-survival-kingshot-collaboration-event-is-coming-soon-get-ready-for-/1032436306067168/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Kingshot</u></i><u> collaboration</u></a>. Its centerpiece, <i>Twin Star Adventure</i>, took players on a cooperative, story-driven polar bear expedition, while alliance competitions such as <i>State of Power</i> and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.facebook.com/WhiteoutSurvival/posts/winter-siege-is-live-weve-prepared-tips-for-each-phase-to-help-chiefs-get-the-ha/1023364280307704/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Winter Siege</u></i></a> kept groups competing throughout the month.<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/5f16a8019f7b275235017614/1482155847?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Royal Match</u></i></a> featured <i>Dragon Nest</i> and the timed <i>Lightning Rush</i> competition during August, adding cooperative and competitive formats to its broader live-ops calendar. Meanwhile,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/55c5028802ac64f9c0001faf/553834731?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Candy Crush Saga</u></i></a> maintained engagement through a well-paced sequence of content, moving from<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://community.king.com/en/candy-crush-saga/discussion/589003/new-bubblegum-season-in-candy-crush-saga-volcanic-panic-is-back" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Bubblegum Season</u></i></a> into the multi-round<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://community.king.com/en/candy-crush-saga/discussion/590857/candy-cup-2026-is-back-all-you-need-to-know-is-right-here" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Candy Cup 2026</u></i></a> tournament before<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://community.king.com/en/candy-crush-saga/discussion/592326/music-season-2026-is-back-create-records-and-earn-sweet-rewards" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Music Season</u></i></a> arrived at the end of August.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">For the full ranking of the top 10 mobile games by revenue, please see the chart above. Please note that data from third-party Android markets is excluded.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Global consumer spending on mobile games across the App Store and Google Play reached <b>$6.57 billion in August</b>, down <b>1% month-over-month</b>. The <b>United States</b> accounted for 28.6% of total revenue, followed by <b>China (iOS only)</b> at 16.7% and <b>Japan</b> at 12.2%.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">On the revenue growth chart,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/55cbfcb4dfec96c24f007d6e/1015521325?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Fate/Grand Order</u></i></a>, a turn-based RPG, ranked No. 1 worldwide. Growth was driven primarily by Japan, where the game recorded its highest monthly revenue of 2026 in August. Its<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://news.fate-go.jp/2026/08/11th_anniversary/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>11th Anniversary celebration</u></a> offered daily login rewards, new missions, special challenges, and limited-time character draws led by the<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://news.fate-go.jp/2026/08/11th_pickup/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>newly introduced Hassan of the Azrael</u></a>. The annual<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.fate-go.jp/special/2026-summer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Swimsuit Event 2026</u></i></a> followed with summer-themed outfits and new collectible characters, helping sustain player spending into early September.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Tencent-owned or published games claimed five of the top 10 spots by worldwide revenue growth in August, led by<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/5da67c09a546ab1edeb6c50d/1480616748?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Teamfight Tactics</u></i></a> and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/68382998ce4e480f8741dede/6535673811?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>VALORANT</u></i></a> at No. 2 and No. 3, respectively. Growth was driven primarily by China. The Chinese version of <i>Teamfight Tactics</i> introduced the<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id1478101301?eventid=6802988897" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Force of Nature</u></i><u> season</u></a>, which refreshed the playable characters and strategic options, alongside a premium<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id1478101301?eventid=6802998137" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>Gwen character cosmetic</u></a> with two interchangeable designs. <i>VALORANT</i> released two themed weapon collections: the traditional Chinese art-inspired<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6-%E6%BA%90%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8/id6535673811?eventid=6796187538" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Ink Warrior</u></i></a> and the floral<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E5%A5%91%E7%BA%A6-%E6%BA%90%E8%83%BD%E8%A1%8C%E5%8A%A8/id6535673811?eventid=6801074106" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Thousand Spirits</u></i></a>, launched as part of the mobile game’s first-anniversary celebrations.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/65c10196ad4adb117910c1d4/1321803705?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Game for Peace</u></i></a>,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/5da680bb42fa0c4364eb64c8/1480616990?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>League of Legends: Wild Rift</u></i></a>, and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/66b1f458d72cf61108f8c2c6/1642894547?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Delta Force</u></i></a> also climbed the rankings. <i>Game for Peace</i> offered characters, weapons, and vehicles from the animated series<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://gp.qq.com/gicp/news/684/18822452.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Swallowed Star</u></i></a>, while <i>Wild Rift</i> combined<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id1455054000?eventid=6792703714" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>fourth-anniversary rewards</u></a> with new<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id1455054000?eventid=6801069728" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Crystal Rose 2026</u></i><u> character outfits</u></a>. <i>Delta Force’s</i><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://df.qq.com/cp/a20240906main/newsdetail.html?id=12929633126496812011" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Treasure Month</u></i></a> encouraged players to log in, complete matches, and hunt for valuable in-game collectibles. Together, these campaigns show how Tencent used major updates, anniversary celebrations, popular entertainment collaborations, and limited-edition cosmetics to bring players back and create new spending opportunities throughout August.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Ranking No. 10 on the worldwide revenue growth chart, newcomer<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/6a4473a21783b08cd04cf3b9/6504389641?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Zeus: The God of Arrogance</u></i></a> has held the No. 1 position by mobile game revenue in South Korea since its late-August launch. Published by Com2uS Holdings, the competitive MMORPG reimagines Greek mythology through large-scale battles, class-based combat, and competitive modes designed for players at different progression levels. It also features an offline system that continues developing characters while players are away and a crafting-focused class that can produce exclusive items, supporting both long-term progression and the in-game economy.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Overall, August’s results showed that effective live ops is as much about pacing as scale. Leading games combined major updates, anniversaries, and IP collaborations with frequent rewards, limited-time modes, premium cosmetics, and locally relevant celebrations, giving players recurring reasons to return and spend throughout the month. Meanwhile, fast-rising newcomers demonstrated that well-positioned launches can still break through a competitive market. Explore<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://playliner.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>Sensor Tower Playliner</u></a> for deeper insights into the live-ops strategies shaping monetization and player engagement.</p><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-118qivm" data-testid="Text-h3"><b>Top 10 Worldwide Mobile Games Download Rankings for August 2026</b></h3><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/55d3a1a802ac64350a000d6e/431946152?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>ROBLOX</u></i></a> was the most downloaded mobile game worldwide in August 2026, followed by <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/59d296dd60104c08ce201a27/1300146617?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Free Fire</u></i></a> at No. 2. <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/622390aa2e0fa027dbdc26b8/1611543739?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Block Blast!</u></i></a>, <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/64870d70b3ae27253f16c069/512939461?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Subway Surfers</u></i></a>, and <a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/6917d8c2c81d300ea38e5ebb/6755482314?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Arrow Puzzle: Tap Puzzle Games</u></i></a> rounded out the top five.</p><img title="2026-aug-top-10-mobile-games-dl" alt="2026-aug-top-10-mobile-games-dl" data-testid="Text-embedded-asset-block" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1110" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-13e50pz-Image-root-Media-root" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1GIm9H3s7oaBZBCLh62d3B/87cc585045b61a6de0941ffbc6face54/2026-08_Gaming_Recap_Rankings_Aug_2026.002.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40"/><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/55d3a1a802ac64350a000d6e/431946152?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>ROBLOX</u></i></a>’s No. 1 position was supported by a diverse lineup of featured experiences throughout August. These included the<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/2376885433/Vesteria" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Vesteria</u></i></a> MMORPG and tactical FPS<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/120189115846709/TTK-Testing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>TTK</u></i></a>, alongside major updates for<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/15101393044/Dress-To-Impress" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Dress to Impress</u></i></a> and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/3260590327/Tower-Defense-Simulator" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Tower Defense Simulator</u></i></a>.<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.roblox.com/games/135486323963203/Duck-Duck" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Duck Duck</u></i></a> added a social party game to the lineup. This steady flow of fresh content across role-playing, shooter, fashion, strategy, and casual gameplay broadened Roblox’s appeal and helped sustain interest in the platform.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><i>Free Fire</i> retained the No. 2 position by worldwide downloads in August, carrying momentum from its<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://ff.garena.com/en/article/1683/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>ninth-anniversary celebration</u></a>, which concluded in late July. Following a quieter start to the month,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcISuAHAdnE/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Scarlet Moon</u></i></a> launched across <i>Free Fire</i> and <i>Free Fire MAX</i> in late August, refreshing the returning collection with new designs and exclusive rewards. The game’s continued strength highlights its sustained global appeal and the lasting momentum generated by its anniversary campaign.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/64870d70b3ae27253f16c069/512939461?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"><i><u>Subway Surfers</u></i></a> climbed three positions month over month to rank No. 4 by worldwide downloads in August. Its<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U0pNyVrJmD8" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Fantasy Fest</u></i></a> World Tour update introduced an enchanted setting, new playable characters, and limited-time challenges, including a back-to-school event with collectible rewards. The late-month<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S0d2e2GvjLI" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Cosmic Crossroads</u></i></a> update shifted the game into a space-themed environment, adding new characters, seasonal reward tracks, and the return of the<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.facebook.com/subwaysurfers/posts/among-us-x-subway-surfers-is-back-crewmate-frank-is-joining-the-other-crewmates-/1585997696888026" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Among Us</u></i><u> collaboration</u></a>. This steady rotation of themed locations, collectible characters, challenges, and crossover content helped keep the game fresh and broaden its appeal to new and returning players.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Global mobile game downloads reached <b>3.76 billion</b> in August, up <b>1% month-over-month</b>. <b>India</b> led with <b>614 million downloads (16.4%)</b>, followed by the <b>United States (7.4%)</b> and <b>Brazil (5.8%)</b>.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Open-world crime games emerged as a notable download trend in August, led by two fast-rising mobile titles.<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/66f136d927e2c12894081fa7/6472700792?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Gangstar Mirage City</u></i></a> ranked No. 1 by worldwide download growth and reached No. 7 by total downloads following its<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.levelinfinite.com/news/gangstar-mirage-city-is-live-in-select-regions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>August 20 multi-region rollout</u></a>. Published by Level Infinite in partnership with Gameloft, the game lets players explore a futuristic city, customize vehicles, build criminal empires, and compete in heists and gang battles.<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/68a16a25e3fe969006684c50/com.bf8.car.street.racing.game3d?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Gangster Miami RP: Grand City</u></i></a> ranked No. 6 by download growth, offering a similar mix of urban exploration, driving, and crime-themed missions. Growth across both titles was supported by high-volume and fast-growing mobile gaming markets such as India, Indonesia, Pakistan, and Brazil. Their rise highlights strong demand for accessible open-world crime games on mobile and coincided with growing anticipation for<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://sensortower.com/grand-theft-auto-VI/sales-tracker" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Grand Theft Auto VI</u></i></a>. Rockstar added to the buzz with an<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://www.rockstargames.com/newswire/article/9k2kaa1o3297k9/grand-theft-auto-vi-an-extended-look" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <u>extended preview</u></a> in late August, ahead of the game’s November 19 launch.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Newcomer<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/6a585eb04228369e1c13b931/com.mystery.dumplings.asmr.unboxing.squishy?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Mystery Dumpling: Unbox ASMR</u></i></a> ranked No. 2 by worldwide download growth and reached No. 12 by total downloads following its August launch. Published by Brocker Bus Studio, the ultracasual title combines mystery-box unwrapping, ASMR-inspired interactions, and colorful cartoon visuals. Its rapid growth was led by Indonesia, Brazil, and Turkey, driving more than 11 million downloads within its launch month.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Vehicle-themed games gained momentum in August, with<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/680b1bcea7ded853e59c2f22/6746743297?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Bus Fever-Car Jam Escape</u></i></a>,<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/69ed5d635d7497e36e4338c7/com.gl.giant.monster.city.run?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Dear Passengers</u></i></a>, and<a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineAlways mui-12tv3mh" href="https://app.sensortower.com/overview/684a54d20082573d53b98416/wheelie.master.street.elite.bikegame?country=WW" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-testid="Text-hyperlink"> <i><u>Wheelie Master: Moto Ride 3D</u></i></a> all entering the top 10 by worldwide download growth. The titles offered distinct casual takes on transportation through bus-sorting puzzles, passenger aviation simulation, and motorcycle stunt riding. Their performance highlights the broad appeal of simple, vehicle-based gameplay across high-volume markets such as India, Indonesia, Brazil, Mexico, and Turkey.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Overall, August’s download rankings balanced the staying power of established global hits with rapid growth from new and emerging titles. Frequent content updates helped leading games remain visible, while accessible concepts spanning open-world crime, ASMR, puzzles, and vehicle simulation found momentum across high-volume mobile markets.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Explore more data and insights for the above game titles with Sensor Tower’s App Performance Insights. You can set up a meeting with our team through the &quot;Request Demo&quot; button on the link provided.</p><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1"><b>Sensor Tower - Your Guide to the Mobile Market</b></p><ul><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">For media inquiries, contact: <u>press-apac@sensortower.com</u></p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">For business inquiries, contact: <u>sales@sensortower.com</u></p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Stay updated on blog and report releases through the Sensor Tower Twitter: @SensorTower </p></li><li><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-npdgv7" data-testid="Text-body1">Please make sure to credit &quot;Sensor Tower&quot; as the source when sharing any content.</p></li></ul><br/></div><hr class="MuiDivider